`comment("DETECTION: Root account activity
Severity: CRITICAL
Why: The root user should never be used day to day. Any root API call or
console login outside a planned break-glass window deserves immediate review.
MITRE ATT&CK: T1078.004 (Valid Accounts: Cloud Accounts)
Runbook: detections/runbooks/root_account_usage.md")`

index=aws sourcetype="aws:cloudtrail" userIdentity.type=Root
| where isnull('userIdentity.invokedBy')
| stats earliest(_time) as first_seen latest(_time) as last_seen count
        values(eventName) as events values(sourceIPAddress) as source_ips
        by userIdentity.accountId
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)
